<title>UK: Venantius sets 125 million stg December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Venantius sets 125 million stg December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Salomon Brothers International Ltd and BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENANTIUS AB (SWEDISH NATIONAL MORTGAGE AGENCY)</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.495   PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.87     SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
